// setting.json — adapt Calradia Remembers to a total-overhaul mod (e.g. The Old Realms).
//
// Every field is OPTIONAL; anything you leave out keeps the Calradia default, so a stock install is
// unchanged. After editing, load your save (or run cr.reload_lore in the console).
//
//   "worldName"           the world's name in prose            ("Calradia" -> "the Old World")
//   "worldAdjective"      the world's adjective                ("Calradian" -> "Imperial")
//   "patriarchalCultures" faction/culture name fragments whose men are skeptical of female authority
//                         (matched case-insensitively against the NPC's faction name)
//
// Example for an Old-World overhaul (uncomment and edit):
// {
//   "worldName": "the Old World",
//   "worldAdjective": "Old-World",
//   "patriarchalCultures": ["Bretonnia", "Empire"]
// }
{}
